WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
Partition pruning: reading only the partitions a query needs.

00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
A table partitioned by date is split into one block per day.

00:05.000 --> 00:11.000
Without a date filter, the query scans all seven partitions.

00:11.000 --> 00:17.000
With a filter on the partition column, only the partition for November 3 is scanned: one of seven.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.600
Filter on the partition column to read fewer partitions and pay less.
